#: benchmark/README.md:4
msgid ""
"Details about the systems used in our benchmark are reported in the table "
"below. Instructions to install [GROMACS](https://www.gromacs.org) and "
"[PLUMED](https://www.plumed.org) as well as a tutorial on preparing the "
"bAIes model for one of these systems can be found "
"[here](https://github.com/COSBlab/bAIes-SM)."
msgstr ""
"Benchmark 系の詳細は次の表にある。[GROMACS](https://www.gromacs.org) と "
"[PLUMED](https://www.plumed.org) の導入手順、および1つの系の bAIes "
"モデルを準備するチュートリアルは[こちら](https://github.com/COSBlab/bAIes-SM)にある。"

